# For more info on HTTP files go to https://aka.ms/vs/httpfile
### Get nodes
POST https://{{ApiHostname}}/api/v1/graph/
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
{
  "query": "g.V().has('isDeleted', false)"
}

### Get edges
POST https://{{ApiHostname}}/api/v1/graph/
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
{
  "query": "g.E()"
}
